# menu.d
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "状态总览"

msgid "Roles"
msgstr "角色"

msgid "Gateway (zero-intrusion)"
msgstr "Gateway（零侵入）"

msgid "Controller (admission & distribution)"
msgstr "Controller（准入与下发）"

msgid "Bridge"
msgstr "网桥"

msgid "Wi-Fi & KVR"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 与 KVR"

msgid "Backup & failover"
msgstr "备份与故障恢复"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

# common.js
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

# overview.js
msgid "(click \"Preview changes\" below to generate)"
msgstr "（点击下方「预览改动」生成）"

msgid "Applied"
msgstr "已应用"

msgid "Roles and duties"
msgstr "角色与职责"

msgid "Current roles"
msgstr "当前角色"

msgid "Automatic bridging"
msgstr "是否自动建桥"

msgid "Allowed (pure AP role)"
msgstr "允许（纯 AP 角色）"

msgid "Not allowed"
msgstr "不允许"

msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "设备 ID"

msgid "Sync mode"
msgstr "同步模式"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Gateway / Controller are read-only, probe-only and push-only; only a \"pure AP\" device (AP without Controller and Gateway) merges all ports into br-lan."
msgstr "Gateway / Controller 只读、只探测、只下发；只有「纯 AP」设备（有 AP 且无 Controller、无 Gateway）才会把所有网口并入 br-lan。"

msgid "Hardware capabilities"
msgstr "硬件能力"

msgid "Device model"
msgstr "设备型号"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Wireless radios"
msgstr "无线 radio"

msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

msgid "Full wpad (KVR)"
msgstr "完整版 wpad（KVR）"

msgid "VLAN capable"
msgstr "VLAN 能力"

msgid "Ports"
msgstr "网口"

msgid "Failover (optional)"
msgstr "故障恢复（可选）"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Applicable"
msgstr "适用性"

msgid "Heartbeat target"
msgstr "心跳目标"

msgid "not configured"
msgstr "未配置"

msgid "This feature is off by default. Only AP devices restore the default network when the Controller/Gateway becomes unreachable."
msgstr "该功能默认关闭。仅 AP 设备会在连不上 Controller/Gateway 时恢复设备默认网络。"

msgid "Admission and backup"
msgstr "准入与备份"

msgid "Pending APs"
msgstr "待批准 AP"

msgid "Approved"
msgstr "已批准"

msgid "Initial baseline"
msgstr "初始化基线"

msgid "established"
msgstr "已建立"

msgid "not established"
msgstr "未建立"

msgid "Dirty shutdown"
msgstr "上次退出是否异常"

msgid "Change preview and apply"
msgstr "改动预览与应用"

msgid "Preview changes (dry-run)"
msgstr "预览改动（dry-run）"

msgid "Apply changes"
msgstr "应用改动"

msgid "Confirm apply"
msgstr "确认应用成功"

msgid "Confirmed, apply-guard released"
msgstr "已确认，apply-guard 已解除"

msgid "Revert last write"
msgstr "回滚最近一次写入"

msgid "Revert the most recent write?"
msgstr "确定回滚最近一次写入吗？"

msgid "Reverted"
msgstr "已回滚"

msgid "For non-AP roles the preview is always \"0 changes\" — the proof of the zero-intrusion design."
msgstr "非 AP 角色下预览结果恒为「0 项改动」—— 这是零侵入设计的证明。"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "控制器"

msgid "AP"
msgstr "AP"

msgid "Gateway"
msgstr "网关"

# roles.js
msgid "Roles saved"
msgstr "角色已保存"

msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

msgid "(a bridge will be created)"
msgstr "（将自动建桥）"

msgid "(no bridge will be created)"
msgstr "（不会建桥）"

msgid "Role settings"
msgstr "角色设置"

msgid "This device has no wireless module: the AP role is disabled and is not part of the default roles."
msgstr "本设备没有无线模块：AP 角色已被禁用，默认角色中也不包含 AP。"

msgid "Does only two things: (1) validate new AP admission; (2) push network information. It never modifies any local network configuration."
msgstr "只做两件事：① 新 AP 准入验证；② 网络信息下发。不改动本机任何网络配置。"

msgid "AP (access point)"
msgstr "AP（接入点）"

msgid "Syncs the network information pushed by the Controller (including Wi-Fi). Only a \"pure AP\" (without Controller and Gateway) merges all ports into br-lan."
msgstr "同步 Controller 下发的网络信息（含 Wi-Fi）。仅「纯 AP」（无 Controller、无 Gateway）才会把所有网口并入 br-lan。"

msgid "This device has no wireless module and cannot take the AP role."
msgstr "本设备无无线模块，不可承担 AP 角色。"

msgid "Only asks you to select the corresponding LAN interface for identification and probing; it never modifies routes, NAT, firewall or any other network configuration."
msgstr "只要求选择对应的 LAN 接口用于识别与探测，绝不修改路由、NAT、防火墙等任何网络配置。"

msgid "Save and show impact"
msgstr "保存并查看影响"

msgid "Bridge rule: enable_bridge = ap && !gateway && !controller"
msgstr "建桥规则：enable_bridge = ap && !gateway && !controller"

msgid "Change preview"
msgstr "改动预览"

msgid "After saving the roles, this shows what the selected role combination would change."
msgstr "保存角色后，这里显示相应角色组合会做哪些改动。"

# gateway.js
msgid "Factory role"
msgstr "出厂角色"

msgid "Carrier"
msgstr "载波"

msgid "e.g. 192.168.1.1 or 192.168.1.1:443"
msgstr "如 192.168.1.1 或 192.168.1.1:443"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "已保存"

msgid "Warning: the local write plan is not empty, please check the overview page!"
msgstr "注意：检测到本机写入计划非空，请到「状态总览」确认！"

msgid "reachable"
msgstr "可达"

msgid "unreachable"
msgstr "不可达"

msgid "method"
msgstr "方法"

msgid "latency"
msgstr "耗时"

msgid "The Gateway role never changes your network for you: here you only select the \"corresponding LAN interface\", which is used for topology identification and connectivity probing. The program does not modify routes, NAT, the firewall or any content of /etc/config/network."
msgstr "Gateway 角色不会代替你修改任何网络：这里只选择「对应的 LAN 接口」，用于拓扑识别与连通性探测。程序不会改动路由、NAT、防火墙或任何 /etc/config/network 内容。"

msgid "Corresponding LAN interfaces"
msgstr "对应 LAN 接口"

msgid "No physical ports were detected (possibly a host or virtual environment)."
msgstr "没有探测到物理网口（可能是宿主机/虚拟环境）。"

msgid "After selecting them, open the overview page and run a dry-run to confirm that it reports 0 changes."
msgstr "选定后请到「状态总览」点一次 dry-run，确认改动数为 0。"

msgid "Connectivity probe (read-only)"
msgstr "连通性探测（只读）"

msgid "Probe target"
msgstr "探测目标"

msgid "Probe"
msgstr "探测"

msgid "Whether the Controller can reach the Gateway is confirmed by you separately: the program only performs ICMP/TCP probes and never writes the routing table, changes the firewall or touches NAT."
msgstr "Controller 与 Gateway 是否连通由你单独确认：程序只做 ICMP/TCP 探测，不会写路由表、不改防火墙、不动 NAT。"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Save LAN interface selection"
msgstr "保存 LAN 接口选择"

# controller.js
msgid "No device has reported yet"
msgstr "暂无设备上报"

msgid "Pending"
msgstr "待批准"

msgid "Rejected"
msgstr "已拒绝"

msgid "Approve"
msgstr "批准"

msgid "Reject"
msgstr "拒绝"

msgid "Revoke"
msgstr "撤销"

msgid "Approve device"
msgstr "批准设备"

msgid "Reject device"
msgstr "拒绝设备"

msgid "Revoke approval of device"
msgstr "撤销批准设备"

msgid "Wi-Fi information of the Controller itself"
msgstr "控制器自身的 Wi-Fi 信息"

msgid "Wi-Fi information of the Gateway (read-only fetch)"
msgstr "网关的 Wi-Fi 信息（只读拉取）"

msgid "Custom information"
msgstr "自定义信息"

msgid "Always available (if this device is also an AP, its own wireless configuration is modified and the confirmation below is required)"
msgstr "始终可用（若本设备同时承担 AP，会修改本机无线配置，需勾选下方确认）"

msgid "Available"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "不可用"

msgid "Please select an available Wi-Fi information source"
msgstr "请选择一个可用的 Wi-Fi 信息源"

msgid "Wi-Fi information source saved"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 信息源已保存"

msgid "(it still has to be confirmed before being applied locally)"
msgstr "（仍需确认后才能应用到本机）"

msgid "This device does not take the Controller role: admission and distribution are unavailable."
msgstr "本设备未承担 Controller 角色：准入与下发不可用。"

msgid "New AP admission"
msgstr "新 AP 准入"

msgid "MAC"
msgstr "MAC"

msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "主机名"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "An AP that has not passed admission receives no information and writes no local configuration (validated twice on the service side)."
msgstr "未通过准入的 AP 不会被下发任何信息，也不会写入本机配置（服务端双重校验）。"

msgid "Wi-Fi information source"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 信息源"

msgid "Gateway address"
msgstr "网关地址"

msgid "If the Gateway reports \"no Wi-Fi\", that source is disabled; the same applies when the Controller itself has no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "若网关上报「没有 Wi-Fi」，该来源会被禁用；控制器自身没有 Wi-Fi 时同理。"

msgid "Custom information (only effective when kind = custom)"
msgstr "自定义信息（仅 kind = custom 时生效）"

msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "加密方式"

msgid "Key reference"
msgstr "密钥引用"

msgid "Band"
msgstr "频段"

msgid "Confirm that the local wireless configuration may be modified"
msgstr "确认可以修改本机无线配置"

msgid "When the AP and the Controller are the same device and custom information is selected, the local Wi-Fi is modified as well, which must be confirmed explicitly."
msgstr "当「AP 与 Controller 是同一台设备」且选择自定义信息时，本机 Wi-Fi 也会被修改，必须显式确认。"

msgid "Save Wi-Fi information source"
msgstr "保存 Wi-Fi 信息源"

msgid "The Controller only distributes this information to admitted APs; choosing \"the Controller itself\" never rewrites the local configuration of the Controller."
msgstr "Controller 只把这些信息下发给已准入的 AP；选择「控制器自身」时不会改写控制器本机配置。"

# bridge.js
msgid "This device is a \"pure AP\": all ports (including the factory WAN port) are merged into br-lan."
msgstr "本设备是「纯 AP」：所有网口（含出厂 WAN 口）会被并入 br-lan。"

msgid "The current role combination creates no bridge and touches no port."
msgstr "当前角色组合不建桥、不动网口。"

msgid "Bridge plan"
msgstr "网桥规划"

msgid "Member ports"
msgstr "成员端口"

msgid "VLAN filtering"
msgstr "VLAN filtering"

msgid "VLANs"
msgstr "VLAN 数"

msgid "No usable physical port."
msgstr "没有可用的物理网口。"

msgid "No bridge needed."
msgstr "无需建桥。"

msgid "Bridge name"
msgstr "网桥名"

msgid "All ports"
msgstr "全部网口"

msgid "LAN ports"
msgstr "LAN 口"

msgid "WAN ports"
msgstr "WAN 口"

msgid "By default only one br-lan is generated; the model is a multi-bridge + VLAN list structure for future extensions (cross-device VLAN sync is not enabled yet)."
msgstr "默认只生成一个 br-lan；模型是多网桥 + VLAN 列表结构，便于后续扩展（VLAN 跨设备同步尚未启用）。"

msgid "What would be written (dry-run)"
msgstr "将写入的内容（dry-run）"

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "（无）"

msgid "This is a zero-write plan: the current role combination does not touch any network configuration."
msgstr "这是零写入计划：本角色组合不会触碰任何网络配置。"

msgid "A snapshot is taken automatically before these changes are applied, so they can be rolled back at any time."
msgstr "以上改动会在应用前自动保存快照，可随时回滚。"

# wifi.js
msgid "(refreshed after saving)"
msgstr "（保存后自动刷新）"

msgid "Full wpad detected: 802.11k/v/r is available."
msgstr "检测到完整版 wpad，802.11k/v/r 可用。"

msgid "KVR unavailable"
msgstr "KVR 不可用"

msgid "the full wpad package is required"
msgstr "需要完整版 wpad"

msgid "Install wpad-mbedtls (or wpad) instead of wpad-basic-mbedtls."
msgstr "请安装 wpad-mbedtls（或 wpad）而不是 wpad-basic-mbedtls。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Ignored when wpad does not support it"
msgstr "wpad 不支持时会被忽略"

msgid "Refusing to enable KVR: the full wpad package is missing."
msgstr "缺少完整版 wpad，拒绝开启 KVR。"

msgid "KVR parameters saved (distributed to APs with the NetworkProfile)"
msgstr "KVR 参数已保存（随 NetworkProfile 下发给 AP）"

msgid "KVR (802.11k / v / r)"
msgstr "KVR（802.11k / v / r）"

msgid "Device radios"
msgstr "设备 radio"

msgid "Mobility domain"
msgstr "漫游域 mobility_domain"

msgid "Save KVR parameters"
msgstr "保存 KVR 参数"

msgid "All KVR parameters are distributed to every AP with the NetworkProfile pushed by the Controller, keeping mobility_domain consistent."
msgstr "所有 KVR 参数随 Controller 下发的 NetworkProfile 统一下发到各 AP，保证 mobility_domain 一致。"

msgid "Wi-Fi relay (no mesh)"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 中继（不使用 mesh）"

msgid "Relay always uses a standard Wi-Fi relay: wpa_supplicant(STA) upstream plus hostapd(AP) downstream."
msgstr "中继一律使用标准 Wi-Fi 中继：上行 wpa_supplicant(STA) + 下行 hostapd(AP)。"

msgid "This program does not implement mesh networking such as 802.11s or batman."
msgstr "本程序不实现 802.11s / batman 等 mesh 组网。"

msgid "If 802.11r is restricted on the relay link, it automatically falls back to ft_over_ds."
msgstr "中继链路下若 802.11r 受限，会自动回退到 ft_over_ds。"

msgid "Resulting write plan"
msgstr "对应的写入计划"

# backup.js
msgid "No snapshots"
msgstr "暂无快照"

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "校验"

msgid "network/wireless/dhcp/firewall/system will be overwritten from the baseline as a whole; user changes in these files will be lost. Continue?"
msgstr "将按基线整体覆盖 network/wireless/dhcp/firewall/system，用户在这些文件里的改动都会丢失。确定继续？"

msgid "Only the keys changed by WifiSync are restored, all other configuration is preserved. Continue?"
msgstr "只会还原 WifiSync 改动过的键，其它配置保持不变。确定继续？"

msgid "Restore finished"
msgstr "恢复完成"

msgid "Restore the default network"
msgstr "恢复默认网络"

msgid "Restore and reboot"
msgstr "恢复后重启"

msgid "Failover settings saved"
msgstr "故障恢复设置已保存"

msgid "Discipline: the initial network baseline is saved before the service starts and the previous network is restored before it stops."
msgstr "纪律：服务启动前自动保存初始化网络基线，服务停止前自动恢复原有网络。"

msgid "The default restore scope is managed_only (only the keys changed by WifiSync are restored)."
msgstr "恢复默认范围是 managed_only（只还原 WifiSync 改过的键）。"

msgid "Baseline state"
msgstr "基线状态"

msgid "not established (created on the first service start)"
msgstr "未建立（首次启动服务时创建）"

msgid "Baseline path"
msgstr "基线路径"

msgid "Last shutdown"
msgstr "上次退出"

msgid "abnormal"
msgstr "异常"

msgid "normal"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "Verify baseline integrity"
msgstr "校验基线完整性"

msgid "Create snapshot now"
msgstr "立即创建快照"

msgid "Snapshot created"
msgstr "快照已创建"

msgid "Prune old snapshots"
msgstr "清理旧快照"

msgid "Pruned old snapshots"
msgstr "已清理旧快照"

msgid "(the baseline is never pruned)"
msgstr "（基线永不清理）"

msgid "Restore baseline (managed_only)"
msgstr "恢复基线（managed_only）"

msgid "Restore baseline (full)"
msgstr "恢复基线（full）"

msgid "The sha256 checksum is verified before restoring; a failed check rejects the restore and the baseline is never deleted."
msgstr "恢复前会先校验 sha256；校验不通过会直接拒绝执行，且永远不会删除基线。"

msgid "Snapshot list"
msgstr "快照列表"

msgid "Kind"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

msgid "Failover (optional, off by default)"
msgstr "故障恢复（可选，默认关闭）"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Only effective on AP devices: the default network is restored after the Controller/Gateway has been unreachable for the configured time."
msgstr "仅 AP 设备生效：连不上 Controller/Gateway 超过设定时间后恢复设备默认网络。"

msgid "Gateway / Controller never trigger such a rollback (zero-intrusion principle)."
msgstr "Gateway / Controller 不会触发这类回滚（零侵入原则）。"

msgid "Heartbeat loss timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "心跳丢失超时（秒）"

msgid "Apply confirmation window (seconds)"
msgstr "应用确认窗口（秒）"

msgid "Trigger action"
msgstr "触发动作"

msgid "Heartbeat target (Controller/Gateway)"
msgstr "心跳目标（Controller/Gateway）"

msgid "Save failover settings"
msgstr "保存故障恢复设置"

# diagnostics.js
msgid "(no logs yet: the stderr of the service is collected by procd, use logread to inspect it)"
msgstr "（暂无日志：服务的 stderr 由 procd 收集，可用 logread 查看）"

msgid "(no logs yet)"
msgstr "（暂无日志）"

msgid "Copied to clipboard"
msgstr "已复制到剪贴板"

msgid "Self-check information (can be pasted into an issue)"
msgstr "自检信息（可直接贴到 issue）"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

msgid "Write plan (full dry-run)"
msgstr "写入计划（dry-run 全量）"

msgid "For non-AP roles this is always \"0 changes\", which is direct evidence of the zero-intrusion design."
msgstr "非 AP 角色时此处恒为「0 项改动」，这是零侵入设计的直接证据。"

msgid "Service log"
msgstr "服务日志"

msgid "Refresh log"
msgstr "刷新日志"

msgid "Copy log"
msgstr "复制日志"

msgid "The service log is also written to syslog and can be inspected with `logread -e wifisync`."
msgstr "服务日志同时写入 syslog，可用 `logread -e wifisync` 查看。"

msgid "Common diagnostic commands"
msgstr "常用诊断命令"

# ── backend messages (crates/wifisync-core/src/message.rs, daemon) ────────
msgid "(no changes)"
msgstr "（无改动）"

msgid "The current role combination creates no bridge and touches no port (%{blockers})"
msgstr "当前角色组合不建桥、不动网口（%{blockers}）"

msgid "the AP role is not enabled"
msgstr "未承担 AP 角色"

msgid "Bridge plan: %{bridge}"
msgstr "网桥规划：%{bridge}"

msgid "KVR: k=%{k} v=%{v} r=%{r} mobility_domain=%{mobility_domain} ft_over_ds=%{ft_over_ds}"
msgstr "KVR：k=%{k} v=%{v} r=%{r} mobility_domain=%{mobility_domain} ft_over_ds=%{ft_over_ds}"

msgid "This device does not take the AP role: the Wi-Fi information is only distributed to APs and does not change the local wireless configuration"
msgstr "本设备不承担 AP 角色：Wi-Fi 信息仅用于下发给 AP，不修改本机无线配置"

msgid "Referenced distributed profile %{profile}"
msgstr "参考下发档案 %{profile}"

msgid "This device has no wireless module; the AP role was removed and the option is disabled"
msgstr "本设备没有无线模块，已取消 AP 角色并禁用该选项"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已关闭"

msgid "Not applicable (not an AP device)"
msgstr "不适用（非 AP 设备）"

msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控中"

msgid "Waiting for apply confirmation"
msgstr "等待应用确认"

msgid "Waiting for heartbeat recovery"
msgstr "等待心跳恢复"

msgid "Restore triggered"
msgstr "已触发恢复"

msgid "The Controller itself has no Wi-Fi"
msgstr "控制器自身没有 Wi-Fi"

msgid "The Gateway reports that it has no Wi-Fi"
msgstr "网关上报没有 Wi-Fi"

msgid "No Gateway selected or connectivity not confirmed yet"
msgstr "网关未选定或连通性未确认"

msgid "Wi-Fi information has not been fetched from the Gateway successfully yet"
msgstr "尚未成功从网关拉取 Wi-Fi 信息"

msgid "Fetching the Wi-Fi information from the Gateway failed"
msgstr "拉取网关 Wi-Fi 信息失败"

msgid "Unknown source"
msgstr "未知来源"

msgid "Source: the Controller's own Wi-Fi information (used as a template only, the local configuration of the Controller is not changed)"
msgstr "来源：控制器自身的 Wi-Fi 信息（仅作为模板下发，不改控制器本机配置）"

msgid "Source: the Gateway's Wi-Fi information (read-only fetch, never written back to the Gateway)"
msgstr "来源：网关的 Wi-Fi 信息（只读拉取，绝不写回网关）"

msgid "Source: user-defined Wi-Fi information"
msgstr "来源：用户自定义 Wi-Fi 信息"

msgid "Note: this device is also an AP, applying custom Wi-Fi information will modify its local wireless configuration"
msgstr "注意：本设备同时承担 AP，应用自定义 Wi-Fi 信息会修改本机无线配置"

msgid "This device has no wireless module"
msgstr "本设备没有无线模块"

msgid "The full wpad package (with 802.11k/v/r) is required: install `wpad` instead of `wpad-basic`"
msgstr "需要完整版 wpad（含 802.11k/v/r），请安装 `wpad` 而不是 `wpad-basic`"

msgid "Backup integrity check passed"
msgstr "备份完整性校验通过"

msgid "Backup check failed: %{missing} missing, %{changed} changed, %{extra} extra"
msgstr "备份校验失败：缺失 %{missing} 项、内容变化 %{changed} 项、多出 %{extra} 项"

msgid "Restore blocked: %{reason}"
msgstr "恢复被阻止：%{reason}"

msgid "Restored %{restored} item(s), %{failed} failed"
msgstr "已恢复 %{restored} 项，失败 %{failed} 项"

msgid "This role combination does not need to modify the network (0 changes)"
